            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changed

- The cinema intros (IMAX, Dolby and Infinity Vision) are gone from the Mac
  app, along with their setting under Before the movie. Trailers before movies
  still work.
- The download is much smaller: about 75 MB, down from almost 600 MB.

### Fixed

- The full-screen button in the player now shows the right icon however you
  entered full screen.
